[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 19920.03, "timestamp": "05:32:00", "text": "你還有現實生活中的事情要做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19939.19, "timestamp": "05:32:19", "text": "網路和現實生活混為一談，否則會……會……會……會……就像一個充氣過度的氣球，隨時都會爆掉。就是那種感覺。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19946.868, "timestamp": "05:32:26", "text": "不要……不要那樣做。你不想讓你的氣球爆掉。讓它……讓氣球裡的空氣慢慢釋放出來。慢慢地。嗯。好的。 [音樂]祝你一切順利。上帝[音樂]也祝你一切順利。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19974.99, "timestamp": "05:32:54", "text": "我們"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 19978.521, "timestamp": "05:32:58", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "that's a thing"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19978.83, "timestamp": "05:32:58", "text": "聊了很多，我都忘了我在做什麼了"}]